h their original Certificates. Candidates who do not meet the eligibility criteria or fail to submit the required documents in proof of their eligibility will be disqualified at this stage.\n Please note that the Initial Document Verification is a preliminary verification stage, and Federal Bank reserves the right to request additional documents in later verification stages if necessary.\n iv) Personal Interview\n Candidates who clear the Initial Document Verification will proceed to the Personal Interview round. Candidates found competent to be positioned in the profile offered by the Bank, will be issued Provisional Offer Letters for empanelment as Officer Sales & Client Acquisition, subsequent to the conclusion of the selection process.\n b) Schedule of the Selection Process\n Activity\n Date\n Reporting Time\n Venue\n Important Instructions\n Pre-Placement Talk\n To be Informed Later\n -\n MS Teams\n MS Teams link for joining the Pre-Placement Talk will be shared to the candidates at least one day prior to the session.\n Online Aptitude Test & Psychometric Assessment\n 03.02.2026\n To be Informed Later\n -\n Admit card & general instructions will be shared by our assessment partner, M/s L&T EduTech Ltd at least two days prior to Online Aptitude Test & Psychometric Assessment.\n Group Discussion\n To be Informed Later\n -\n MS Teams\n Results of Group Discussion round will be intimated through the Fed-Recruit App.\n Initial Document Verification\n To be Informed Later\n -\n -\n Detailed instructions regarding the documents to be uploaded in the Fed-Recruit Mobile App is available in the attached Campus Program Handout\n Personal Interview\n To be Informed Later\n Show Less",
