    "job_description": "From your seniors:\nStarting my career at Superset shaped how I think about engineering.\nI joined as an intern and grew into an SDE-3 over ~4 years. What stood out wasnt just the role progressionit was the ownership and trust I got early. Freshers arent kept on the sidelines here. You learn by building and shipping real systems that run at real scale.\nEarly on, we supported large hiring drives with thousands of candidates being interviewed every hour. Within months, I was on client calls understanding problems, working directly with the founders, and helping improve system performance and reliabilityhandling peak loads while making the experience smoother for candidates and recruiters.\nIt can be high-pressure, but the learning is unmatched. You dont just write codeyou learn to make trade-offs, understand users, and build systems that hold up in production. If you want a steep learning curve and real impact early, Superset is a strong place to start.\n\n- Vivek Sengar, CSE, BITS Pilani Goa - 2021\n\nAbout Superset\nSuperset is Indias largest campus recruitment platform. For the last 10 years, weve worked with large enterprises to streamline fresher hiring, partnered with universities to run placements end-to-end, and helped students discover opportunities, prepare, and get hired.\nWhat we build\nRecruitment SaaS: employer branding, outreach, applications, assessments, interviews, hiring ops, analytics, and everything in between.\nAI products for recruitment: communication assessments, AI interviews, AI-enabled learning/practice experiences (LMS, mock interviews), and more.\nHigh-scale, multi-region, enterprise-grade systems: durable infra with compliance built in from day one.\nScale youll ship at\n2.1M monthly active users, 5L daily active users\nServices running at ~1300 RPS\nFrom day 1, your work impacts lakhs of students across backgrounds and some of the largest hiring teams in the country.\nYoull also get hands-on with modern problem 